OL,3,GNEWSATeen becomes youngest known woman
OL,4,Ato run length of GB
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old has become the youngest
OL,7,Fknown woman to run the length of Great
OL,8,FBritain.
OL,10,FPhoebe Harris, a student at Lord
OL,11,FWandsworth College near Hook,
OL,12,FHampshire, ran more than 1,000 miles
OL,13,F(1,609km) from John O'Groats to Land's
OL,14,FEnd in 68 days.
OL,16,FThe challenge, which began on 20 June
OL,17,Fand ended on Wednesday, has seen her
OL,18,Fraise about #5,000 for two charities,
OL,19,Fwhile also receiving three A grades in
OL,20,Fher A-levels.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
